  "notes": "Both images show the same pinout diagram (JPG and higher-resolution PNG); transcribed separately per rule 11. Labels use GPIO names with the silkscreen/CircuitPython name first in functions; Power Domain tags (RTC, CPU, SPI/CPU) omitted. ADC names printed with a space (ADC2 CH5), copied as printed. BOOT and DEBUG pads have no callout; silkscreen names used. HUB75 right column rows 4 and 8 are both printed MTX_ADDRE / GPIO21, copied as printed. Buttons (DOWN, UP, RESET, Boot), NeoPixel, LED, BOOT0 and accelerometer interrupt callouts are not wiring points and were skipped."
